{
 "id": "b55c294d-ae0e-4f56-a1d4-3aa889712064",
 "type": "manga",
 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Kanpeki Sugiru ga Kosando mo Konyaku Hakisareta Reijou wa Ringoku no Outaishi to Musubareru?!"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "完璧すぎるが故三度も婚約破棄された令嬢は隣国の王太子と結ばれる！？"
   },
   {
    "en": "The Perfect Lady With Three Failed Engagements Ends up with the Crown Prince of a Neighboring Nation?!"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "In the prestigious Academy of Magic and Arcana, Sophia stands out as an honor student. Her younger sister, Mia, consumed by jealousy over Sophia's success, has sabotaged three of her marriage proposals. After her latest engagement is ruined, Sophia grows weary of Mia's wrath. Just then, Luke, the crown prince of a neighboring country, reaches out to her. The two quickly bond over their shared love of magic, becoming a hot topic at the academy. Determined to prevent Sophia from finding happiness, Mia prepares to make her move...",
   "ja": "魔法学校でトップの成績を誇る優等生・ソフィア。彼女はその優秀さから妹・ミアに激しく嫉妬され、なんと三度も婚約者を略奪されてしまう。度重なるミアの嫌がらせに、酷く心を痛めるソフィア。そんな彼女に声をかけてきたのは、留学生である隣国の王太子ルーク。魔法の話題で意気投合した二人は、徐々に距離を縮めていく。しかし、そんなルークにもミアの魔の手が迫ろうとしていた…。"
  },
